{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbExciting train driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where open tracks with various situations and a physically simulated driving sensation are connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPhysical simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not a system that runs on a predetermined line. The feature of this game is that the wheels actually roll and run on the rails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSettings and missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a train driver supporting the growth of the emerging city-state &quot;Chamland Republic&quot; that is developing in the mountainous region. Complete missions and contribute to the development of the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCooperative system that loosely connects with others</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate with other players through contribution points and achieve common goals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897310?t=1764742055","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3897310?t=1764742055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/a465489a622ea1a07f21cc8d1a4908ba82894595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764742055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897310/a465489a622ea1a07f21cc8d1a4908ba82894595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764742055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4018880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbExciting train driving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where open tracks with various situations and a physically simulated driving sensation are connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbPhysical simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is not a syst